--
N5008 [expr.prim.fold]/1-2: a fold over the parameter pack of a variable
template or of a function template WITHOUT a function parameter pack
(`(__is_same(T, Ts) || ...)`, `(sizeof(Ts) + ...)`) expands against
the template pack's elements; the pattern's pack reference may sit in a
type position (sizeof operand, builtin-trait argument).  Before, the fold
node reached the residual fallback and degraded to `true`.
